WEBVTT

00:11:59.631 --> 00:12:00.799
Yeah.

00:12:00.841 --> 00:12:02.301
But check this out.

00:12:02.342 --> 00:12:05.304
This is what I just loved,
was when I told the boys

00:12:05.345 --> 00:12:07.848
that they were going
to have to buy their own ticket,

00:12:07.848 --> 00:12:11.185
Silas, remembering back
to what he had done

00:12:11.226 --> 00:12:12.978
when he was about nine years old,

00:12:13.020 --> 00:12:15.355
he said to his brothers,

00:12:15.355 --> 00:12:17.441
"That's easy, don't worry about it.

00:12:17.483 --> 00:12:18.984
I'll show you how to do it."

00:12:19.026 --> 00:12:20.527
(Laughter)

00:12:20.569 --> 00:12:21.695
Yes.

00:12:22.488 --> 00:12:24.615
And sure enough,

00:12:24.656 --> 00:12:28.452
they worked hard over several months,
and they did just that.

00:12:28.869 --> 00:12:31.747
They were able to earn enough money